1
00:07:45,882 --> 00:07:51,882
In an impossible time, it takes impossible courage.

2
00:15:31,764 --> 00:15:37,764
Bonhoeffer: Pastor. Spy. Assassin is a history, drama,
war film directed by Todd Komarnicki.

3
00:23:17,647 --> 00:23:23,647
As the world teeters on the brink of annihilation, Dietrich Bonhoeffer joins a deadly plot to
assassinate Hitler, risking his faith and fate to save millions of Jews from genocide.

4
00:31:03,529 --> 00:31:09,529
Dietrich Bonhoeffer, played by Jonas Dassler.

5
00:38:49,411 --> 00:38:55,411
Young Dietrich Bonhoeffer, played by Phileas Heyblom.

6
00:46:35,294 --> 00:46:41,294
Martin Niemoller, played by August Diehl.

7
00:54:21,176 --> 00:54:27,176
Frank Fisher, played by David Jonsson.

8
01:02:07,058 --> 01:02:13,058
Karl Bonhoeffer, played by Moritz Bleibtreu.

9
01:09:52,941 --> 01:09:58,941
Paula Bonhoeffer, played by Nadine Heidenreich.

10
01:17:38,823 --> 01:17:44,823
Bonhoeffer (released as Bonhoeffer: Pastor.

11
01:25:24,705 --> 01:25:30,705
Assassin.) is a 2024 historical drama thriller film about the German theologian and anti-Nazi
dissident Dietrich Bonhoeffer, written, produced and directed by Todd Komarnicki.

12
01:33:10,588 --> 01:33:16,588
It stars Jonas Dassler, August Diehl, David Jonsson, Flula
Borg, Moritz Bleibtreu, and Clarke Peters.

13
01:40:56,470 --> 01:41:02,470
The film was released in the United States on November 22, 2024.

14
01:48:42,352 --> 01:48:48,352
It attracted some controversy regarding political
interpretations and historical inaccuracies.

15
01:56:28,235 --> 01:56:34,235
The film explores themes of assassin, spy,
pastor, pacifism, based on true story.

16
02:04:14,117 --> 02:04:20,117
The tone is emotional.
